      "message": "Hi, Peiyong:\nThe public method \u0027getPackageInfo\u0027 can be called in the work thread.\nThe public method \u0027handleApplicationInfoChanged\u0027 be called in the UI thread.\nIn the above scenario, deadlock is easy to occur.\n\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\n\"main\" prio\u003d5 tid\u003d1 Blocked\nheld mutexes\u003d\nat android.app.ActivityThread.getStringCoreSetting(ActivityThread.java:7844)\nwaiting to lock \u003c0x0d2d8ecc\u003e (a android.app.ResourcesManager) held by thread 17\nat android.app.LoadedApk.createOrUpdateClassLoaderLocked(LoadedApk.java:836)\nat android.app.LoadedApk.updateApplicationInfo(LoadedApk.java:364)\nlocked \u003c0x0bb02515\u003e (a android.app.LoadedApk)\nat android.app.ActivityThread.handleApplicationInfoChanged(ActivityThread.java:6128)\n---------\n\"SysUiBg\" prio\u003d5 tid\u003d17 Blocked\nheld mutexes\u003d\nat android.app.LoadedApk.updateApplicationInfo(LoadedApk.java:363)\nwaiting to lock \u003c0x0bb02515\u003e (a android.app.LoadedApk) held by thread 1\nat android.app.ActivityThread.getPackageInfo(ActivityThread.java:2387)\nlocked \u003c0x0d2d8ecc\u003e (a android.app.ResourcesManager)\nat android.app.ContextImpl.createPackageContextAsUser(ContextImpl.java:2319)",
